.8): bedroom 2 and bedroom 3 walls against the foyer void (not in the partition list).
- P1 collision for P4: the archWindow at (8..9,2..4 / 6..8, 11) puts its west shutter at (7,y,10), which is the turret east wall (x7 z9..10). Shutter refused there; move it or accept it.
- P1 ceiling y9 smooth_quartz over the foyer void x13..20 z10 and house interior; P6's chandelier hangs below y9 (y6..8 air).
